 feeling helpless before towering, overwhelming masculine strength feels kinda nice in some ways?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_20","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_21","text":"... Sorry. Bad joke. You don't have to look at me like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_22","text":"Please, continue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_23","text":"I realized that if there's someone to hold me back, I might not make the wrong choice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_24","text":"And what would that be?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_boomtheghost2_epilogue_25","text":"Ending your life, for starters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":n